# Bitter Work: "Exhaust -- {4}: Earthbend 4. Activate only during your turn." Bot1 cannot activate it on Bot2's turn 2 though
# five mana are available (CR 602.5b). On turn 3 four Moxen pay: the Mountain is a 4/4 land creature with haste and four +1/+1
# counters, and attacking Bot2 with it draws a card (power 4, CR 508.1): library 12 after the draw step, 11 after the trigger.
# On turn 4 Bot2's Terror kills it (an Island is discarded to Bot2's hand size) and it returns to the battlefield tapped, a
# plain land (CR 701.66a). On turn 5 the exhaust ability cannot be activated again (CR 702.177a).

